                    <h3>What is Estate Creation?</h3>
                    <p>
                        Estate Creation is a financial planning approach that helps you organize your assets, insurance policies, and financial arrangements for your family’s future. Life insurance can be an important part of this planning by providing financial benefits to the nominee or beneficiaries, subject to the policy terms and conditions.
